#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "Batteries replaced too often: {first} d then {second} d (under 30 d)"
msgstr ""
"Batterierne skiftes for ofte: {first} d og derefter {second} d (under 30 d)"

#: apihub-app/akm-core/src/advice.rs
msgid ""
"Check the declared chemistry ([battery] chemistry), try fresh cells of "
"another batch or low self-discharge NiMH cells, and switch the keyboard off "
"when it is not used."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollér den angivne kemi ([battery] chemistry), prøv nye celler fra et "
"andet parti eller NiMH-celler med lav selvafladning, og sluk tastaturet, når "
"det ikke bruges."

