msgstr "hid_apple-parametre (alle eller én)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)"
msgstr "Vis denne meddelelse eller hjælpen til de angivne underkommandoer"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Change a setting (administrator authentication required)"
msgstr "Ændr en indstilling (administratorgodkendelse påkrævet)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Set the Fn mode of hid_apple (0-4). Global to ALL Apple keyboards; asks for "
"administrator authentication through polkit (pkexec akm-helper)"
msgstr ""
"Indstil Fn-tilstanden for hid_apple (0-4). Fælles for ALLE Apple-tastaturer; "
"beder om administratorgodkendelse via polkit (pkexec akm-helper)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "0 disabled, 1 fkeyslast, 2 fkeysfirst, 3 auto, 4 fkeysdisabled"
msgstr "0 disabled, 1 fkeyslast, 2 fkeysfirst, 3 auto, 4 fkeysdisabled"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Also write it to /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf so it survives reboots"
msgstr ""
"Skriv den også til /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf, så den overlever "
"genstarter"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Set a hid_apple parameter (fnmode 0-4, iso_layout -1..1, swap_opt_cmd 0-2, "
"swap_ctrl_cmd 0-1, swap_fn_leftctrl 0-1). Global to ALL Apple keyboards"
msgstr ""
"Indstil en hid_apple-parameter (fnmode 0-4, iso_layout -1..1, swap_opt_cmd "
"0-2, swap_ctrl_cmd 0-1, swap_fn_leftctrl 0-1). Fælles for ALLE Apple-"
"tastaturer"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Also write it to /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf"
msgstr "Skriv den også til /etc/modprobe.d/hid_apple.conf"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Rename the keyboard on this computer (BlueZ alias; nothing is written into "
"the keyboard). With --device-name: the name stored IN the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"Omdøb tastaturet på denne computer (BlueZ-alias; intet skrives til "
"tastaturet). Med --device-name: navnet gemt I tastaturet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"TWO NAMES:\n"
"  akmctl rename <name>                 alias of THIS computer (BlueZ Alias): "
"nothing written into the keyboard\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name <name>   WRITES the name stored IN the "
"keyboard (seen by every host):\n"
"                                       pre-flight, backup of the current "
"name, ONE confirmation [y/N]\n"
"                                       (--yes skips it and works without a "
"terminal), one write, immediate\n"
"                                       read-back, verdict. No password in "
"the active local session.\n"
"                                       --check: whole pre-flight and backup, "
"nothing written, nothing asked\n"
"                                       --dry-run: shows the bytes, no "
"pkexec, nothing written\n"
"                                       --verbose: frames, wire bytes, proof, "
"[devname] journal\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --show   name stored in the keyboard, from the "
"daemon's cache\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --restore <backup.json> [--yes]   write a "
"backup back (same flow)\n"
"Exit codes of --device-name: 0 written and read back identical (or --check "
"green), 10 no terminal and\n"
"no --yes, 11 pre-flight refused, 12 cancelled, 13 written but not read back "
"(check with --show),\n"
"14 read back different (rollback command printed), 15 write uncertain (the "
"write failed on its way:\n"
"a frame may have been sent, check with --show). Persistence across a battery "
"change is not measured\n"
"(docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md)."
msgstr ""
"TO NAVNE:\n"
"  akmctl rename <navn>                 alias på DENNE computer (BlueZ "
"Alias): intet skrives til tastaturet\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name <navn>   SKRIVER navnet gemt I tastaturet (ses "
"af alle værter):\n"
"                                       forhåndskontrol, sikkerhedskopi af "
"nuværende navn, ÉN bekræftelse [y/N]\n"
"                                       (--yes springer den over og virker "
"uden terminal), én skrivning, øjeblikkelig\n"
"                                       tilbagelæsning, vurdering. Ingen "
"adgangskode i den aktive lokale session.\n"
"                                       --check: fuld forhåndskontrol og "
"sikkerhedskopi, intet skrevet, intet spurgt\n"
"                                       --dry-run: viser bytene, ingen "
"pkexec, intet skrevet\n"
"                                       --verbose: rammer, byte på "
"forbindelsen, bevis, [devname]-journal\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --show   navn gemt i tastaturet, fra "
"tjenestens cache\n"
"  akmctl rename --device-name --restore <kopi.json> [--yes]   skriv en "
"sikkerhedskopi tilbage (samme forløb)\n"
"Afslutningskoder for --device-name: 0 skrevet og læst tilbage identisk "
"(eller --check grøn), 10 ingen terminal og\n"
"ingen --yes, 11 forhåndskontrol afvist, 12 annulleret, 13 skrevet men ikke "
"læst tilbage (kontrollér med --show),\n"
"14 læst tilbage anderledes (tilbagerulningskommando udskrevet), 15 skrivning "
"usikker (skrivningen fejlede undervejs:\n"
"en ramme kan være sendt, kontrollér med --show). Vedvarenhed efter "
"batteriskift er ikke målt\n"
"(docs/RENAME-KEYBOARD.md)."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "New alias (max 64 characters, no control characters)"
msgstr "Nyt alias (højst 64 tegn, ingen kontroltegn)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Restore the keyboard's own name"
msgstr "Gendan tastaturets eget navn"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to rename (default: the one the daemon reports)"
msgstr "Tastatur, der skal omdøbes (standard: det, tjenesten melder)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Write the name stored IN the keyboard (printable ASCII, 1-32 characters); "
"without a value: with --show or --restore"
msgstr ""
"Skriv navnet gemt I tastaturet (udskrivbar ASCII, 1-32 tegn); uden værdi: "
"med --show eller --restore"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Do not ask the confirmation (works without a terminal)"
msgstr "Spørg ikke om bekræftelse (virker uden terminal)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show the bytes that would be sent, write nothing, no pkexec"
msgstr "Vis de byte, der ville blive sendt, skriv intet, ingen pkexec"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Whole pre-flight (control-channel MTU read via ONE pkexec, read-only) and "
"backup; nothing written, nothing asked"
msgstr ""
"Fuld forhåndskontrol (MTU for kontrolkanalen læst via ÉN pkexec, kun "
"læsning) og sikkerhedskopi; intet skrevet, intet spurgt"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Accepted for compatibility, no effect: --device-name writes by default"
msgstr ""
"Accepteres af hensyn til kompatibilitet, ingen virkning: --device-name "
"skriver som standard"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show the name stored in the keyboard (daemon cache, no hardware read)"
msgstr "Vis navnet gemt i tastaturet (tjenestens cache, ingen hardwarelæsning)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Write back a backup made by a previous --device-name run"
msgstr ""
"Skriv en sikkerhedskopi tilbage, lavet af en tidligere kørsel med --device-"
"name"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Byte-by-byte detail (frames, wire, proof, [devname] journal)"
msgstr "Detaljer byte for byte (rammer, forbindelse, bevis, [devname]-journal)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Follow StateChanged signals: one JSON line per change, until interrupted"
msgstr ""
"Følg StateChanged-signaler: én JSON-linje pr. ændring, indtil afbrydelse"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Battery history (single store: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"history.jsonl)"
msgstr ""
"Batterihistorik (ét enkelt lager: $XDG_STATE_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"history.jsonl)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Oldest entry: 90m, 24h, 7d, 2w, YYYY-MM-DD or \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\" (UTC)"
msgstr ""
"Ældste post: 90m, 24h, 7d, 2w, YYYY-MM-DD eller \"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\" (UTC)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Newest entry (same formats)"
msgstr "Nyeste post (samme formater)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keep only the last N entries"
msgstr "Behold kun de seneste N poster"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "JSON array on one line instead of the table"
msgstr "JSON-array på én linje i stedet for tabellen"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Export the history on stdout"
msgstr "Eksportér historikken til stdout"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "CSV format (the only one; header included)"
msgstr "CSV-format (det eneste; med overskriftslinje)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Import a history file of the former Python CLI into the single store. The "
"source is not modified; existing lines are not duplicated"
msgstr ""
"Importér en historikfil fra den tidligere Python-CLI til det fælles lager. "
"Kilden ændres ikke; eksisterende linjer dubleres ikke"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "File to import (history.jsonl of the Python CLI)"
msgstr "Fil der skal importeres (history.jsonl fra Python-CLI'en)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Terminal chart of the battery (percentage and voltage) over 24 h or 7 days"
msgstr ""
"Terminaldiagram over batteriet (procent og spænding) over 24 t eller 7 dage"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Time window"
msgstr "Tidsvindue"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"JSON for a waybar/polybar custom module (classes: good, warning, critical, "
"disconnected)"
msgstr ""
"JSON til et brugerdefineret waybar/polybar-modul (klasser: good, warning, "
"critical, disconnected)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Prometheus text exposition of the keyboard state (one page)"
msgstr "Tastaturets tilstand i Prometheus-tekstformat (én side)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Switch a keyboard LED (NumLock can only be switched off)"
msgstr "Skift en lysdiode på tastaturet (NumLock kan kun slukkes)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Ask the daemon to send WillShutdown (Feature 0x40, id only) to the keyboard, "
"as macOS does at shutdown: once, only if connected and `[apple] "
"will_shutdown` is on. Run by the shutdown unit"
msgstr ""
"Bed tjenesten sende WillShutdown (Feature 0x40, kun id) til tastaturet, som "
"macOS gør ved nedlukning: én gang, kun hvis forbundet og `[apple] "
"will_shutdown` er slået til. Køres af nedlukningsenheden"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Do nothing unless the system is shutting down or restarting (`systemctl is-"
"system-running` = stopping): used by the unit, so that a logout or a service "
"restart never sends it"
msgstr ""
"Gør intet, medmindre systemet lukker ned eller genstarter (`systemctl is-"
"system-running` = stopping): bruges af enheden, så et log ud eller en "
"genstart af tjenesten aldrig sender det"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Send HID_CONTROL SUSPEND (0x13) or EXIT_SUSPEND (0x14) to the connected "
"Apple keyboards, as macOS bluetoothd does at sleep and wake: one byte on the "
"HID control channel of bluetoothd, administrator authentication. The system "
"units send it by themselves at every sleep/wake; this is the manual test. --"
"dry-run writes nothing"
msgstr ""
"Send HID_CONTROL SUSPEND (0x13) eller EXIT_SUSPEND (0x14) til de forbundne "
"Apple-tastaturer, som bluetoothd i macOS gør ved dvale og opvågning: én byte "
"på bluetoothd's HID-kontrolkanal, administratorgodkendelse. Systemenhederne "
"sender det selv ved hver dvale/opvågning; dette er den manuelle test. --dry-"
"run skriver intet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"suspend: HID_CONTROL SUSPEND, byte 0x13 (what the suspend unit sends before "
"sleep); exit-suspend: HID_CONTROL EXIT_SUSPEND, byte 0x14 (what the resume "
"unit sends at wake)"
msgstr ""
"suspend: HID_CONTROL SUSPEND, byte 0x13 (det, dvale-enheden sender før "
"dvale); exit-suspend: HID_CONTROL EXIT_SUSPEND, byte 0x14 (det, "
"genoptagelses-enheden sender ved opvågning)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Only this keyboard (must be a connected Apple keyboard)"
msgstr "Kun dette tastatur (skal være et forbundet Apple-tastatur)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Show the bluetoothd socket that would be used (pid, fd, MAC, PSM, state) and "
"send nothing"
msgstr ""
"Vis den bluetoothd-sokkel, der ville blive brugt (pid, fd, MAC, PSM, "
"tilstand), og send intet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Register map of the keyboard (every known HID report: name, size, safety "
"class) with the values the daemon has cached, \"never read\" otherwise. "
"Never reads the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"Registeroversigt over tastaturet (hver kendt HID-rapport: navn, størrelse, "
"sikkerhedsklasse) med værdierne fra tjenestens cache, ellers \"aldrig "
"læst\". Læser aldrig tastaturet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON"
msgstr "Maskinlæsbar JSON"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Firmware version of the keyboard against the embedded table of Apple's "
"public firmware updates, where one exists (read once per connection by the "
"daemon; no network, never flashes)"
msgstr ""
"Tastaturets firmwareversion sammenlignet med den indbyggede tabel over "
"Apples offentlige firmwareopdateringer, hvor en sådan findes (læses én gang "
"pr. forbindelse af tjenesten; intet netværk, flasher aldrig)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Read the 3 allowed HID reports (0x47, 0x46, 0x49) with the safe read policy: "
"no scan, never 0x4C / 0xFE / 0x01. Press a key first (an idle keyboard is "
"left alone)"
msgstr ""
"Læs de 3 tilladte HID-rapporter (0x47, 0x46, 0x49) med den sikre "
"læsepolitik: ingen scanning, aldrig 0x4C / 0xFE / 0x01. Tryk først på en "
"tast (et inaktivt tastatur lades i fred)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Diagnose the Bluetooth link in one command (BlueZ, pairing, adapter power "
"management, BlueZ/UPower configuration, journal, hidraw, daemon). Read-only "
"unless --fix; run with sudo to also compare the stored and kernel link keys"
msgstr ""
"Diagnosticér Bluetooth-forbindelsen med én kommando (BlueZ, parring, "
"adapterens strømstyring, BlueZ/UPower-konfiguration, journal, hidraw, "
"tjeneste). Kun læsning medmindre --fix; kør med sudo for også at sammenligne "
"den gemte nøgle med kernens forbindelsesnøgle"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to check (default: the paired one)"
msgstr "Tastatur, der skal kontrolleres (standard: det parrede)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Apply the corrections of the system files the diagnostic proposes (BlueZ "
"main.conf, udev rule of the adapter), through the privileged helper: one "
"administrator authentication, the previous file kept as <name>.akm-bak"
msgstr ""
"Anvend de rettelser af systemfiler, som diagnosen foreslår (BlueZ main.conf, "
"adapterens udev-regel), via den privilegerede hjælper: én "
"administratorgodkendelse, tidligere fil gemt som <navn>.akm-bak"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "With --fix: show what would change, write nothing (no password)"
msgstr "Med --fix: vis hvad der ville ændres, skriv intet (ingen adgangskode)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"With --fix: also restart bluetooth / upower so the corrected file is read "
"now (drops every Bluetooth link for a few seconds)"
msgstr ""
"Med --fix: genstart også bluetooth / upower, så den rettede fil læses straks "
"(afbryder alle Bluetooth-forbindelser i nogle sekunder)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "With --fix: also apply the corrections marked \"optional\" (UPower)"
msgstr "Med --fix: anvend også rettelserne markeret \"valgfri\" (UPower)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Guided repair of the link: wake + reconnect first; re-pair only after a "
"typed confirmation (the pairing is never removed otherwise)"
msgstr ""
"Guidet reparation af forbindelsen: opvågning + genforbindelse først; ny "
"parring kun efter en indtastet bekræftelse (ellers fjernes parringen aldrig)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Keyboard to repair (default: the paired one)"
msgstr "Tastatur, der skal repareres (standard: det parrede)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Offer re-pairing even if the link looks healthy"
msgstr "Tilbyd ny parring, selv om forbindelsen ser sund ud"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Effective table of the special keys (F1-F12, Eject; --all: every known key): "
"physical key -> evdev code (after hwdb and hid_apple, per fnmode) -> keysym "
"-> KDE global shortcut. Never reads a key press, except with --live"
msgstr ""
"Faktisk tabel over specialtasterne (F1-F12, Eject; --all: alle kendte "
"taster): fysisk tast -> evdev-kode (efter hwdb og hid_apple, pr. fnmode) -> "
"keysym -> global KDE-genvej. Læser aldrig et tastetryk, undtagen med --live"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Verdict per key ([ok] = a KDE shortcut is bound) and what to test"
msgstr ""
"Vurdering pr. tast ([ok] = en KDE-genvej er bundet) og hvad der skal testes"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "All known keys (modifiers, arrows, Fn...), not only the top row"
msgstr ""
"Alle kendte taster (modifikatorer, piletaster, Fn...), ikke kun den øverste "
"række"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Machine-readable JSON (with the KDE actions)"
msgstr "Maskinlæsbar JSON (med KDE-handlingerne)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Live view of the key events of the Apple keyboard instead of the table: HID "
"usage, evdev code, name, one line per press and release. Reads the evdev "
"node (read-only, group \"input\"), records nothing. Leave with Escape held 2 "
"s, or Ctrl-C"
msgstr ""
"Direkte visning af Apple-tastaturets tastehændelser i stedet for tabellen: "
"HID-brug, evdev-kode, navn, én linje pr. tryk og slip. Læser evdev-noden "
"(kun læsning, gruppen \"input\"), optager intet. Afslut ved at holde Escape "
"i 2 s, eller Ctrl-C"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Manual key mapping without keyd ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"keymap.toml -> udev hwdb, installed with administrator authentication)"
msgstr ""
"Manuel tastetilknytning uden keyd ($XDG_CONFIG_HOME/apple-kb-monitor/"
"keymap.toml -> udev hwdb, installeret med administratorgodkendelse)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Show the profiles of keymap.toml (--hwdb: the file `apply` would install)"
msgstr ""
"Vis profilerne i keymap.toml (--hwdb: filen, som `apply` ville installere)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Remap a key: KEY = F1..F12, Eject, Fn, LeftCmd... or a HID usage (0x7003a); "
"CODE = a KEY_* name of linux/input-event-codes.h. Applied by `apply`"
