"Omtilknyt en tast: KEY = F1..F12, Eject, Fn, LeftCmd... eller en HID-brug "
"(0x7003a); CODE = et KEY_*-navn fra linux/input-event-codes.h. Anvendes af "
"`apply`"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Profile to edit (default: the active one)"
msgstr "Profil, der skal redigeres (standard: den aktive)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Back to the kernel mapping for one key (in keymap.toml)"
msgstr "Tilbage til kernens tilknytning for én tast (i keymap.toml)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Preset of a profile (hid_apple parameters): apple (Apple legend, fnmode=1 "
"swap_opt_cmd=0), fkeys (F1-F12 first, fnmode=2), linux-pc (Cmd<->Alt, "
"swap_opt_cmd=1), none (parameters left as they are, the default)"
msgstr ""
"Forudindstilling for en profil (hid_apple-parametre): apple (Apple-mærkning, "
"fnmode=1 swap_opt_cmd=0), fkeys (F1-F12 først, fnmode=2), linux-pc (Cmd<-"
">Alt, swap_opt_cmd=1), none (parametrene lades uændrede, standard)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Select the active profile (created with the apple preset if new)"
msgstr ""
"Vælg den aktive profil (oprettes med forudindstillingen apple, hvis den er "
"ny)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Install the active profile: udev hwdb (akm-helper install-keymap) and "
"hid_apple parameters (akm-helper, persistent, ALL Apple keyboards)"
msgstr ""
"Installér den aktive profil: udev hwdb (akm-helper install-keymap) og "
"hid_apple-parametre (akm-helper, vedvarende, ALLE Apple-tastaturer)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show what would change, change nothing"
msgstr "Vis hvad der ville ændres, ændr intet"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Remove the installed hwdb (kernel mapping back at once) and clear the keys "
"of the active profile"
msgstr ""
"Fjern den installerede hwdb (kernens tilknytning tilbage med det samme) og "
"ryd den aktive profils taster"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Restore the previously installed hwdb file"
msgstr "Gendan den tidligere installerede hwdb-fil"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Add the KDE shortcuts the Apple legend needs and KDE lacks (F4 = Launch (D) "
"-> application launcher), never replacing a binding"
msgstr ""
"Tilføj de KDE-genveje, som Apple-mærkningen kræver, og som KDE mangler (F4 = "
"Launch (D) -> programstarteren), erstatter aldrig en binding"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Remove exactly the keys kde-apply added"
msgstr "Fjern præcis de taster, som kde-apply tilføjede"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Health self-check (daemon, link, journal, crashes, disk), run by apple-kb-"
"monitor-selfcheck.timer"
msgstr ""
"Sundhedstjek (tjeneste, forbindelse, journal, nedbrud, disk), køres af apple-"
"kb-monitor-selfcheck.timer"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Print the result as JSON (the same object as selfcheck.json)"
msgstr "Udskriv resultatet som JSON (samme objekt som selfcheck.json)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Desktop notification for each NEW grave problem (deduplicated)"
msgstr ""
"Skrivebordsbekendtgørelse for hvert NYT alvorligt problem (uden dubletter)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid ""
"Also open one Gitea issue per new grave problem (deduplicated; needs "
