#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"RE-PAIRING ({why}).\n"
"This REMOVES the pairing of “{name}” on this computer, then starts the "
"pairing assistant.\n"
"The keyboard will not work until pairing is done: keep another input device "
"at hand.\n"
"Type {CONFIRM} then Enter to go on, or just Enter to cancel: "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"NY PARRING ({why}).\n"
"Dette FJERNER parringen af “{name}” på denne computer og starter derefter "
"parringsassistenten.\n"
"Tastaturet virker ikke, før parringen er gennemført: hav en anden inputenhed "
"ved hånden.\n"
"Skriv {CONFIRM} og derefter Enter for at fortsætte, eller blot Enter for at "
"annullere: "

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "refused: interactive confirmation required (stdin is not a terminal)."
msgstr "afvist: interaktiv bekræftelse påkrævet (stdin er ikke en terminal)."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "  pairing removed."
msgstr "  parring fjernet."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
#, rust-format
msgid "  pairing not removed (RemoveDevice: {e})"
msgstr "  parringen ikke fjernet (RemoveDevice: {e})"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"→ Switch the keyboard off (power button, 3 s) and on again: its light blinks "
"(pairing mode).\n"
"→ In the assistant, pick the keyboard, type the displayed code ON THE "
"KEYBOARD, then Enter."
msgstr ""
"→ Sluk tastaturet (tænd/sluk-knappen, 3 s) og tænd det igen: lyset blinker "
"(parringstilstand).\n"
"→ Vælg tastaturet i assistenten, skriv den viste kode PÅ TASTATURET, og tryk "
"Enter."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"  No graphical assistant: `bluetoothctl`, then `scan on`, `pair <MAC>`, type "
"the code on the keyboard, `trust <MAC>`, `connect <MAC>`."
msgstr ""
"  Ingen grafisk assistent: `bluetoothctl`, derefter `scan on`, `pair <MAC>`, "
"skriv koden på tastaturet, `trust <MAC>`, `connect <MAC>`."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "  (waiting for the assistant…)"
msgstr "  (venter på assistenten…)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid "✓ Keyboard re-paired, connected and trusted."
msgstr "✓ Tastaturet parret igen, forbundet og betroet."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"✗ No paired + connected keyboard after 4 min. Run `akmctl repair` again."
msgstr ""
"✗ Intet parret og forbundet tastatur efter 4 min. Kør `akmctl repair` igen."

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/repair.rs
msgid ""
"\n"
"CLEAN FORGET, like macOS: the keyboard is connected, the computer first "
"sends it “RecantConnection”\n"
"(SET Feature 0x41, one byte, wire 53 41), waits 2 s for the link to drop, "
"then ONLY removes the pairing.\n"
"The exact effect of 0x41 on the keyboard was never measured (simple drop or "
"forgetting this computer).\n"
"Then, to re-pair: switch the keyboard off (3 s) and on (blinking light = "
"pairing mode),\n"
"pick it in the assistant and type the displayed code ON THE KEYBOARD, then "
"Enter."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"REN GLEMNING, som i macOS: tastaturet er forbundet, computeren sender det "
"først “RecantConnection”\n"
"(SET Feature 0x41, én byte, på forbindelsen 53 41), venter 2 s på at "
"forbindelsen afbrydes og fjerner derefter KUN parringen.\n"
"Den præcise virkning af 0x41 på tastaturet er aldrig målt (simpel afbrydelse "
"eller glemmer denne computer).\n"
"For derefter at parre igen: sluk tastaturet (3 s) og tænd det (blinkende lys "
"= parringstilstand),\n"
"vælg det i assistenten, og skriv den viste kode PÅ TASTATURET, og tryk Enter."

